LineComment   "// Generic readable-member projection. A member projected off a generic type is"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// instantiated: the type argument is substituted for the parameter through the"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// member's declared type, so Box<string>.value — written Box.value<string> in a"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// type position — is string. Four shapes resolve: a direct application, a"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// concrete alias of one, an applied generic-alias chain, and a forward"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// reference. Nominal identity survives substitution, and the projection is a"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// type — named in a type position or consumed by a comptime assert, never stored."
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// A getter is a readable member too, so it projects through a generic exactly as"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// a field does — the symmetry closed at the end of this file."
Newline       "\n"
Newline       "\n"
